## 6. Java/JDK and Jenkins

Installed Java/JDK as a prerequisite for Jenkins.

After Java/JDK installation, Jenkins was installed successfully.

The Jenkins dashboard configuration was not part of this task.

---

## 7. Dockerfile with Node.js

Created a simple Node.js resource file:

```text
app.js
```

Created a Dockerfile without a file extension.

The `Dockerfile` and `app.js` were kept in the same directory.

Workflow:

```text
app.js
   ↓
Dockerfile
   ↓
Build Image
   ↓
Run Container
   ↓
Test Application
```

Built the image:

```bash
docker build -t node-app .
```

Ran the container and tested the application.

---

## 8. Git and GitHub

Checked the changes:

```bash
git status
```

Added the Dockerfile and Node.js file:

```bash
git add Dockerfile app.js
```

Committed the changes:

```bash
git commit -m "Add Dockerfile and Node.js resource file"
```

Pushed the changes:

```bash
git push
```

Verified the files in GitHub.

